      "content": "the hotlines don't get it though. they just want to keep you \"stable\" so you can keep going through the motions. but there's nothing to go through. my body is just a broken souvenir of a life that ended when my career did. it feels like my story finished a long time ago, and i'm just stuck in the epilogue.",
