      "role": "user",
      "content": "new chapters? i don't see how that works. the version of me that could actually *do* things, that actually had value... that person is dead. it feels like the universe already finished with me. why is there this pressure to keep dragging this shell around when the actual person is long gone? it just feels like a waste of time at this point.",
